  unitName: Blazing Dragon Lyonesse
  unitId: 10947
  unitNumber: 1458
  description: Historians view her death in a battle with the daughter of the lion
    demon clan's chief as a certainty. Had she escaped death in Grand Gaia, she likely
    would have gone on to act as an elite enforcer for Barion alongside her younger
    brother. At the time, the balance of power in Ishgria was extremely tenuous.
    Had Barion's forces been even slightly stronger, his secret plans definitely
    would have taken flight sooner than they did in reality.
  summonDesc: Whoever my foe is, I will fight...<br>I will fight for Lord Barion...<br>And
    for the family of the one person who matters!
  fusionDesc: I'll just give my brother the excess power... Hehe, he seems like he's
    got it together, but he's still just a kid at heart.
  evoDesc: With my brother and me here, no one will be allowed to interfere with
    Lord Barion!
  element: 1
  rarity: 7
